Package: fastslide-capi
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: WAIV CI <ci@wearewaiv.com>
Description: FastSlide C API shared library (runtime)
 FastSlide whole-slide image reader - C API (libfastslide_c.so), installed
 into an architecture-agnostic /usr/lib/fastslide directory.
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), @JPEG_RUNTIME@ (>= 2.1.0), libopenjp2-7 (>= 2.4.0), libzstd1 (>= 1.4.8), zlib1g (>= 1:1.2.11)

Package: fastslide-capi-dev
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: WAIV CI <ci@wearewaiv.com>
Description: FastSlide C API shared library (development files)
 Headers and pkg-config file for building against the FastSlide C API
 (libfastslide_c.so).
Depends: fastslide-capi (= @VERSION@-1)
